    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an intriguing journey in our 2D typing game, where you take on the role of a fearless woman seeking answers in an abandoned space base. Uncover what befell the crew as you face possessed creatures, all through your ability of typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmospheric underground vibe, where every keystroke unveils dark secrets and challenges your typing skills. The mystery unfolds as you progress, typing to defeat possessed beings and unravel the enigmas surrounding the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a one-of-a-kind gaming experience, where a captivating narrative intertwines with typing mechanics, creating an atmosphere that goes beyond words. Are you prepared to unravel the secrets buried in the shadows of the space base? The journey begins with the press of the first key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982570/extras/df84d688896a249dc3b5dbeac9b3b8f2.poster.avif?t=1742586617\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982570/extras/df84d688896a249dc3b5dbeac9b3b8f2.webm?t=1742586617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Vertical Slice Project</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an intriguing journey in our 2D typing game, where you take on the role of a fearless woman seeking answers in an abandoned space base. Uncover what befell the crew as you face possessed creatures, all through your ability of typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmospheric underground vibe, where every keystroke unveils dark secrets and challenges your typing skills. The mystery unfolds as you progress, typing to defeat possessed beings and unravel the enigmas surrounding the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a one-of-a-kind gaming experience, where a captivating narrative intertwines with typing mechanics, creating an atmosphere that goes beyond words. Are you prepared to unravel the secrets buried in the shadows of the space base? The journey begins with the press of the first key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982570/extras/df84d688896a249dc3b5dbeac9b3b8f2.poster.avif?t=1742586617\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982570/extras/df84d688896a249dc3b5dbeac9b3b8f2.webm?t=1742586617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Vertical Slice Project</p>",
